{"id":"6815fd70ccb59d87c1feb00eb85e2d2772d5d5ec3a827241025a9ebb2a731c8b","at":"2026-10-27T05:47:05Z","commit":"963a1431394075ffe9fcbe06375bacfbcc51619a","parents":["043b8a707563085ec1f832af625a14644edc1ffdc5a94ac92e59eb444aa348e6"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.Ash.BackendTest: the backend: this release's limits: no second factor, no password change, no generator, a row per sign-in","hash":"36b66ac4"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/06-limits.md#ash-known","hash":"0775830e"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"two password sign-ins leave two revocation rows; must_change_password false and no pending step; verify_second_factor :unsupported; the application's modules include no Mix task (no generator). The directory's extras not stored is 05 section 4's test, which needs the directory","basis":"review"}
