{"id":"49f7551f53c9c6f6997baef752e81e8d788a27570568f6ec9c993f80d9637b1d","at":"2026-10-27T05:47:08Z","commit":"963a1431394075ffe9fcbe06375bacfbcc51619a","parents":["80731fd05a02f5d3799e3830d0cf259e1925355ae377b3615a20318b5b7d9275"],"op":"relate","type":"verifies","ends":[{"kind":"test","id":"Macaw.Auth.Ash.BackendTest: throttle: the backoff doubles from the last failure to a 15-minute cap; the longer key's wait holds","hash":"54127630"},{"kind":"spec","id":"spec/01-backend.md#ash-throttle","hash":"ee939b4c"}],"by":"Doug ClymerOlson <doug@yarina.org>","note":"fifteen failures each spaced by the previous wait, 2^(n-5) s from the last failure, each refused :throttled 1 ms early; after fifteen the wait is the 900 s cap; pat's username wait (six failures) outlasts her address's (five) so .30 still throttles her while another user signs in from it; a disabled user's right passwords count as failures. Not checked: the ETS table's owner (macaw_auth's)","basis":"review"}
